It's worth noting that _any_ body armor will interfere with a wizard's
spellcasting now, yes.  There is a huge problem in vanilla with wizards
being able to suit up with the full equipment, armour, and stats of a 
Barbarian, and yet have all the spell skills available; an obvious 
imbalance.  This seemed the best way to correct it, and another reason
the wizard is guaranteed the "protection" spell from the start of the
game.

